            "action_name": {
              "value": "Link Swords"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(flourish, stance)\n\nRequirements: Jin-Hae is wielding two hook swords\n\nJin-Hae either links her swords together or unlinks them. If the swords are linked, she can make linked hook sword Strikes; if the swords are unlinked, she can make hook sword Strikes."
